We've recently updated to patchlevel 7, and I like the fact you can
see your intrinsics when you die.  What I wouldn't mind seeing,
though, is the potions, scrolls and spellbooks you use but can't identify over
the course of the game--the spellbook that teleported you across the
dungeon when you tried to read it, the potion that merely gave you a
peculiar feeling, etcetera.  
Also, because it asks if you want to see your inventory and asks if
you want to see your intrinsics, how about if it asks if you want to
see the high score board.  I really don't like waiting while the
machine prints the gravestone and listings--I just want my score and
whether I made it on the board or not--not everyone else's listings to
compare.  

Also, (the perennial request) I would like to get Nethack for the IBM.
Could anybody out there write me with where to purchace/copy it?  How
much does it cost?  Thanx!
